{"sourceUrl":"https://hzxy.swust.edu.cn/2026/0707/c1964a240154/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:51:24.657623+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://hzxy.swust.edu.cn/2026/0707/c1964a240154/page.htm","html":"<div><div><p><br/></p><p><span><span>为了让全国各高校相关</span><span>专业大学三年级优秀本科生了解西南科技大学环境与资源学院，吸引校内外优秀大学生报考我校研究生，增进校际间学生的交流和导师与学生间的相互了解和沟通，我院将于</span>20</span><span>2</span><span>6<span>年</span></span><span>8</span><span>月</span><span><span>31</span><span>日</span></span><span>开展优秀大学生暑期</span><span>研学</span><span>活动。</span></p><p><span>本次暑期</span><span><span>研学主题为</span><span>“安全科学与工程前沿”，</span></span><span><span>拟招收营员共</span>120~130<span>名，欢迎全国各高校相关专业的优秀本科生报名参加，自即日起开始报名。</span></span></p><p><strong><span>一、申请对象及申报资格</span></strong></p><p><span>1<span>、</span></span><span>安全大类（安全工程、应急技术与管理）</span><span>大学本科理工类三年级在校学生。</span></p><p><span>2<span>、学习成绩优秀，思想表现优良。</span></span></p><p><span>3<span>、通过国家英语四级、英语六级、</span><span>TOEFL</span><span>、</span><span>GRE/GMAT</span><span>等考试者优先。</span></span></p><p><span>4</span><span>、科研项目主要参加者或在核心期刊上发表过学术论文者优先；在各级科技创新活动中获得奖励者优先。</span></p><p><strong><span>二、</span></strong><strong><span>计划与安排</span></strong></p><p><span><span>        1</span><span>、本次活动针对校内学生采用线下交流，校外学生考虑路途和时间等原因采用线上交流方式（后续会在</span><span>QQ</span><span>群给出线上交流会议号）。</span></span></p><p><span><span>        2</span><span>、有意愿申请的同学请尽快加入</span><span>QQ</span><span>暑期研学交流群：</span></span><span>555634774</span><span>。本次研学活动信息及后续相关交流也在该群。加群的</span><span>截止日期为</span><span>202</span><span>6</span><span><span>年</span><span>8</span><span>月</span><span>28</span><span>日，逾期不再加人</span></span><span>。</span></p><p><strong><span>三</span></strong><strong><span>、日程安排（</span></strong><span>本日程为暂定计划）</span><strong></strong><strong></strong></p><p><strong><span>     “安全科学与工程前沿”研学学术报告安排</span></strong><strong></strong></p><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span>时间</span></p></td><td><p><span>活动安排</span></p></td><td><p><span>地点</span></p></td><td><br/></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>1</span><span>4:0</span><span>0</span><span>-14:15</span></p></td><td><p><span>开幕式</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>地点：环资学院第一会议（东</span><span>7B 401</span><span>会议室）</span></span></p></td><td><br/></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"4\"><p><span><span>8</span><span>月</span><span>31</span><span>日下午学术报告，地点：环资学院第一会议</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>时间</span></p></td><td><p><span>报告人姓名</span></p></td><td><p><span>报告主题</span></p></td><td><br/></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>14:20-14:35</span></p></td><td><p><span>谭钦文</span></p></td><td><p><span>互联智能背景下安全管理模式创新</span></p></td><td><br/></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>14:35-14:50</span></p></td><td><p><span>吴爱军</span></p></td><td><p><span>传统文化视域下我国安全事故致因解构</span></p></td><td><br/></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>14:50-15:05</span></p></td><td><p><span>薛冰</span></p></td><td><p><span>燃烧与爆炸安全前沿进展</span></p></td><td><br/></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>15:05-15:20</span></p></td><td><p><span>刘年平</span></p></td><td><p><span>灾害事故智慧应急科技发展研究</span></p></td><td><br/></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>15:20-15:35</span></p></td><td><p><span>颜翠平</span></p></td><td><p><span>脉冲喷吹金属滤袋除尘器清灰性能的研究</span></p></td><td><br/></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>15:35-15:50</span></p></td><td><p><span>徐中慧</span></p></td><td><p><span>安全功能材料的研究进展</span></p></td><td><br/></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>15:50-16:05</span></p></td><td><p><span>张岱宇</span></p></td><td><p><span>智能传感系统研究</span></p></td><td><br/></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>16:05-16:20</span></p></td><td><p><span>许秦坤</span></p></td><td><p><span>新能源汽车电池架构对受限空间火灾影响分析</span></p></td><td><br/></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>16:20-16:35</span></p></td><td><p><span>王永强</span></p></td><td><p><span>安全独立仪表系统的风险分析方法</span></p></td><td><br/></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>16:35-16:50</span></p></td><td><p><span>吕娟</span></p></td><td><p><span>烟气脱硫技术研究进展</span></p></td><td><br/></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>16:50-17:05</span></p></td><td><p><span>罗尧东</span></p></td><td><p><span>工程安全检测与监测技术</span></p></td><td><br/></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>17:05-17:20</span></p></td><td><p><span>林龙沅</span></p></td><td><p><span>超细粉碎、分级及通风除尘技术</span></p></td><td><br/></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>17</span><span>:</span><span>2</span><span>0-1</span><span>8</span><span>:00</span></p></td><td colspan=\"2\"><p><span>其它专业老师介绍及优秀学生代表学习心得分享</span></p></td><td><br/></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>1</span><span>8</span><span>:00</span><span>-</span><span>1</span><span>8</span><span>:30</span></p></td><td colspan=\"2\"><p><span><span>考研政策宣讲与答疑，主持人：薛</span><span>冰</span></span></p></td><td><br/></td></tr></tbody></table><p><span> </span></p><p><span>环境与资源学院</span></p><p><span>20</span><span>2</span><span>6<span>年</span></span><span>7</span><span><span>月</span>7<span>日</span></span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><br/></p></div></div>","textSha256":"f50f0e30ffbb78bdef7be176f99cca52acc9fd74c527e12762821969c479244d","textLength":989,"sourceSha256":"70ef293327d09679417da50e8c92d9ddf24231d96ffc1dc1026f767c5c59e36b","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-1990ec8511ab447ced0b","title":"2026年西南科技大学环境与资源学院2026年大学生暑期研学活动通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:51:24.657623+00:00"}
